Approach: Two Pointer

Use two pointers i and j (start and end).
If characters match → move both pointers.
If mismatch happens → we are allowed to delete at most one character.
So we check:
Skip left character → check palindrome (i+1, j)
Skip right character → check palindrome (i, j-1)
If any one is palindrome → return true.

Complexity:
Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
